Package: ktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: ktop contributors <ktop@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/thieuson1984/ktop
Description: compact Linux terminal system monitor and process manager
 Displays live CPU, memory, network, storage and process information directly
 from Linux procfs and sysfs, with interactive process-management controls.
 This package contains a statically linked executable with no shared-library
 runtime dependencies. It does not install a daemon or privileged helper.
